{"path":"keyword/and","title":"C++ keyword: and","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">C++ keyword:</span><code>and</code>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/keyword/and","section":"keyword","kind":"page","summary":"","html":"<h3 id=\"Usage\">Usage</h3>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/operator_alternative\">alternative operators</a>: as an alternative for <code>&amp;&amp;</code>\n</li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    static_assert<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw2\">false</span> and <span class=\"kw2\">false</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"kw2\">false</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    static_assert<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw2\">false</span> and <span class=\"kw2\">true</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>  <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"kw2\">false</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    static_assert<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw2\">true</span>  and <span class=\"kw2\">false</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"kw2\">false</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    static_assert<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw2\">true</span>  and <span class=\"kw2\">true</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>  <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"kw2\">true</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/w/cpp/keyword/and_eq\"><code>and_eq</code></a>\n</li><li> <a href=\"/w/cpp/keyword/bitand\"><code>b